apparently proved this racial difference&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:22.940
but despite this sort of conflict and disagreement&nbsp;
disagreement it was ultimately cartwright's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:22.940 --> 00:21:29.660
perspective view and racial ideas that won&nbsp;
the day and not just his day but ours as well&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:30.860 --> 00:21:36.220
because of course between the 1850s and now the&nbsp;
