than whites lived on unchanged well after&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:50.060 --> 00:21:58.220
cartwright was dead and buried such that today&nbsp;
150 years after cartwright's original flawed work&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:58.940 --> 00:22:05.100
every time a person performs this test or&nbsp;
interprets the results they become implicated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:05.100 --> 00:22:12.060
