it shows us how easily and seamlessly the&nbsp;
past can live through the present and part&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:50.460 --> 00:22:58.220
by obscuring the existence of the past so in this&nbsp;
particular case you know i highly doubt that there&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:58.220 --> 00:23:04.300
are very many nurses pulmonologists or respiratory&nbsp;
therapists who perform this test who have any idea&nbsp;&nbsp;

